  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>A classic design with modern touches, the Big Kids' Nike Air Force 1 Low Casual Shoes completes any low-key look with fresh, classic vibes. Dressed in a smooth, supple leather upper for premium durability and structure, their perforated construction increases ventilation for a breathable wearing experience. Enhanced with a comfort-elevated system that combines a plush footbed with the brand's iconic Air-Sole unit, they cradle feet with a light, cushioned feel.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Big Kids' Nike Air Force 1 Low Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Boys'</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Grade School</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Court Blue/White/Dutch Blue</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>CT3839_012</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Grade School - Boys')</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px